{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tilnize</strong> is a puzzle game where you design sorting lines in a tile factory. Your task is to build a line that correctly sorts the incoming tiles, using a limited set of devices. Behind its simple appearance lies a deep puzzle experience that challenges you to experiment and find the solution through trial and error.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The key to solving the puzzle is how you use the devices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage provides a specific set of devices to work with. Examples include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A device that rotates tiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A device that splits tiles based on their shape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A device that cuts out tiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A device that stacks multiple tiles together and sends them along the line</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the constraints of each level, you must figure out the correct line to solve the challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thoughtful, line-building puzzle experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 diverse levels to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starts simple but ramps up to satisfyingly difficult levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique mechanics and constraints in every level</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you conquer all the challenges this factory has to offer?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Junior Tilnizer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3719050/33f19d2ae7dc1a56c37b396f0f5eef9f38d993c5.jpg"},{"name":"Skilled Tilnizer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3719050/ba489c9cd25903827ab575a58f9ec60c888ce4fc.jpg"},{"na